    [Doc][Misc]fix Qwen3.5-397B benchmark command (#19925)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Correct the vLLM benchmark example in Section 8.2 of the
    Qwen3.5-397B-A17B model guide:
    
    - Use the deployed `Eco-Tech/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B-w8a8` model instead of
    the MTP-specific checkpoint.
    - Replace the invalid `--random-input` argument with the supported
    `--random-input-len` argument.
    
    This keeps the documented benchmark command consistent with the intended
    W8A8 deployment and current vLLM CLI options.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    Documentation-only change. It corrects the reference benchmark command;
    no runtime source code, API, or model behavior changes.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - Reviewed the updated Shell command for the expected vLLM benchmark CLI
    argument and model identifier.
    - Verified the commit changes only
    `docs/source/tutorials/models/Qwen3.5-397B-A17B.md`.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/544f182d9f0c9bfe8bd7645525951d5e3692a542
    
